    {
      "id": "sec_s1l5_r2",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Kya aapne kabhi socha hai ke kitne 'parhe likhe Musalman' apni poori zindagi Qur'an ko samajhne ki koshish kiye baghair guzaar dete hain. Aaj apne aap se ahad karein ke aap Arabi seekhne ki jadd-o-jehad karenge taake Allah Ta'ala ka paigham samajh sakein. mein Sha Allah!",
        "content": "Kya aapne kabhi socha hai ke kitne 'parhe likhe Musalman' apni poori zindagi Qur'an ko samajhne ki koshish kiye baghair guzaar dete hain. Aaj apne aap se ahad karein ke aap Arabi seekhne ki jadd-o-jehad karenge taake Allah Ta'ala ka paigham samajh sakein. mein Sha Allah!",
        "hinglish_text": "Kya aapne kabhi socha hai ke kitne 'parhe likhe Musalman' apni poori zindagi Qur'an ko samajhne ki koshish kiye baghair guzaar dete hain. Aaj apne aap se ahad karein ke aap Arabi seekhne ki jadd-o-jehad karenge taake Allah Ta'ala ka paigham samajh sakein. mein Sha Allah!"
      }
